[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10081.23, "timestamp": "02:48:01", "text": "旅行。我会回来找你的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10084.71, "timestamp": "02:48:04", "text": "之后。你好，这里是6频道，对吗？不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10086.95, "timestamp": "02:48:06", "text": "呃，这里人不多，但有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10088.51, "timestamp": "02:48:08", "text": "人们将会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10092.23, "timestamp": "02:48:12", "text": "这里。等等，11频道。我在里面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10093.309, "timestamp": "02:48:13", "text": "渠道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10094.99, "timestamp": "02:48:14", "text": "11."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10098.79, "timestamp": "02:48:18", "text": "哇。你好。是的。呃，当田野是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10103.87, "timestamp": "02:48:23", "text": "这取决于我们，我们能战胜它，而且很可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10107.03, "timestamp": "02:48:27", "text": "呃，我们以后就不能再做任何事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10111.19, "timestamp": "02:48:31", "text": "这个厨师是因为每个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10113.309, "timestamp": "02:48:33", "text": "玩谁来玩这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10117.63, "timestamp": "02:48:37", "text": "第一局，就像瞬间击杀一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10121.83, "timestamp": "02:48:41", "text": "整个频道。所以，它会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10125.429, "timestamp": "02:48:45", "text": "虽然很难，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10130.15, "timestamp": "02:48:50", "text": "呃，我们可以为银胡子做这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10132.75, "timestamp": "02:48:52", "text": "至少有两个，我想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10136.15, "timestamp": "02:48:56", "text": "因为那时候游戏刚推出的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10138.79, "timestamp": "02:48:58", "text": "大概过了四五天之后，我们就"}]